     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Carlos,<div>I modified it like so:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">wellPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tPanel&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">style </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;overflow-y:scroll; max-height: 600px&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>other</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stuff</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>and it works as I intended.</div><div>Thanks.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
