     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br>On Monday, 30 March 2015 20:26:17 UTC+2, Carlos Sánchez  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <br><br>You can get a scrollable wellpanel like this:<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">wellPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tPanel&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               style </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;overflow:scroll; overflow-y: hidden&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               whatever</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">you</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">want</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">to</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">put</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inside</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br>In this case, it is only scrollable in the x-direction but modify the css accordingly.<br><br>Carlos<br><br>On Friday, March 27, 2015 at 4:47:35 PM UTC+1, Tareef Kawaf wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">This is more of a shiny question than a <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp